---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Max Sapo">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="A product operator with a finance brain and an AI obsession."
    lede="I have worked across capital markets, investing, big-tech product, startups, and AI interfaces. The through-line: finding leverage where systems, incentives, and human behavior meet."
  />
  <section class="container prose">
    <p>
      I am an AI product leader based in the San Francisco Bay Area. My current work is focused on AI infrastructure and performance — the substrate that determines what intelligent products can actually do in the real world.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that, I founded Happyverse.AI, where we built real-time conversational video avatars and explored what emotionally intelligent AI companions could become. I also organized the AGI Interface Summit, a gathering around a simple question: if intelligence becomes abundant, what should the interface look like?
    </p>
    <p>
      Earlier, I worked in product at Google, earned an MBA from Stanford, became a CFA charterholder, and spent the first chapter of my career in finance and private equity — including work on the Detsky Mir IPO.
    </p>
    <h2>What I care about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>AI infrastructure as a product and strategy layer.</li>
      <li>Interfaces that make AI feel useful, trustworthy, and human-compatible.</li>
      <li>Founder/operator psychology: judgment, focus, taste, resilience.</li>
      <li>Markets, incentives, and how technology gets adopted in practice.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This site is a home for my writing, selected work, talks, and occasional field notes from the frontier. Less press release, more working notebook.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
